# Needs the dev test stock (TST). Proves the runner's safety rule: orders a scenario did not create
# (the player's) are frozen while it runs, even across advanced days.
name orders a scenario did not create are frozen while it runs: a limit buy below the price stays open through a day
set-price TST 100
run-days 1
remember TST
show-buy TST
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-Limit
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 5
type FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 95
click Button
expect-orders-delta 1
freeze-new-orders
expect-log order(s) frozen while a game UI test runs
set-price TST 90
run-days 1
expect-orders-delta 1
expect-owned-delta TST 0
cleanup:
cancel-new-orders
set-price TST 100
close-dialog
